%N A399947 Decimal expansion of 31*Pi/6 - sqrt(3).
%C A399947 This constant is the area of Cundy and Rollett's egg with unit pointed-end radius. The broad semicircle has radius 2, and the two side arcs have radius 3. The area is the sum of the broad semicircle, the trapezoid formed by the four arc joins, and three circular segments of central angle Pi/3 with radii 3, 3, and 1.
%D A399947 H. M. Cundy and A. P. Rollett, Mathematical Models, 3rd ed., Tarquin Publications, 1989, pp. 19-21.
%D A399947 R. Dixon, Mathographics, Dover, 1991, p. 11.
%H A399947 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/CundyandRollettsEgg.html">Cundy and Rollett's Egg</a>.
%e A399947 14.4995112359783877718628778054382258680759033...
%t A399947 First[RealDigits[31 Pi/6 - Sqrt[3], 10, 87]]
%Y A399947 Cf. A376642 (area of Moss's egg).
%Y A399947 Cf. A401885 (area of the pentagon egg).
